// Per-host niri overrides. Rendered by chezmoi; empty where nothing applies.
{{- if dig "tuxedo" false . }}

// Hybrid-GPU laptop: eDP hangs off the Intel iGPU, the external DP port off
// the RTX 3050. Rendering on the GPU that does not drive the screen copies
// every frame across GPUs and lags (niri-wm/niri#3095, #4708), so the render
// device follows the connected displays: render.kdl is written before each
// niri start by scripts/render-device.sh (niri.service.d/render-device.conf).
include "render.kdl"
{{- end }}
